# Workspace-level ignores

# Environment / secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Python caches & venvs anywhere
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/

# Node / Next artifacts anywhere
**/node_modules/
**/.next/

# OS / IDE
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Logs
**/*.log

# Eval outputs (generated)
evals/results_log.csv
evals/scorecard.md
